<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD width="100%"><IMG height=181 src="http://www.vismaiorguild.org/lootpics/White_Ornate_Chain_Bridle.gif" width=400 border=0></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD width="100%">
<P align=center>Grats Genalen</P>
<P align=center>&nbsp;</P></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD width="100%"><IMG height=184 src="http://www.vismaiorguild.org/lootpics/Shield_of_Mental_Fortitude.gif" width=405 border=0> </TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD width="100%">
<P align=center>Grats Eppie &amp; Darmond</P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></CENTER>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Of course, all good raids are accompanied by some equally...interesting comments.&nbsp; To wit:</P>
<DIV align=center>
<CENTER>
<TABLE id=AutoNumber2 style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" borderColor=#111111 cellSpacing=3 cellPadding=3 width="60%" border=0>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD width="100%">
<P align=center><IMG height=20 src="http://www.vismaiorguild.org/screenshots/Kalakar_Baby.gif" width=552 border=0></P></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD width="100%">
<P align=center><IMG height=33 src="http://www.vismaiorguild.org/screenshots/Xelera_Baby.gif" width=552 border=0></P></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD width="100%">
<P align=center>Calling Dr. Freud, calling Dr. Freud - it appears that our Necromancers have some unresolved issues with their Mommy's.</P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></CENTER></DIV>
<P><STRONG>Today's News &amp; Notes:</STRONG></P>
<UL>
<LI><B>COIRNAV ESCAPES FROM EVERQUEST: </B>According to <A href="http://www.cnn.com/2003/WORLD/americas/07/02/chile.science.reut/index.html" target=_blank>this article</A> on the CNN website, Chilean scientists are baffled by the appearance of "<SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px">...a huge, gelatinous sea creature found washed up on the southern Pacific coast and were seeking international help identifying the mystery specimen".&nbsp; Believe it....or not?</SPAN> 
<LI><B>IT'S PROTECTED SPEECH...SO THERE: </B>A former Intel worker who "spammed" his former colleagues with e-mails criticizing his former employer had his day in the California Supreme Court ... and won.&nbsp; According to the ruling, the "...<SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14px">barrage of e-mails sent by a fired Intel worker disparaging his former employer did not constitute trespassing"</SPAN>.&nbsp; <A href="http://www.cnn.com/2003/LAW/07/01/email.speech.ap/index.html" target=_blank>The article</A> is on the CNN website.</LI></UL>&nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                  <tr> 
